:: pick up the wire
<<set $hasWire to ['True']>>
<<set $circuitRoomState to [2]>>
<<goto circuit_tutorial>>

:: attach the wire
<<set $hasWire to ['False']>>
<<set $circuitRoomState to [3]>>
<<goto circuit_tutorial>>



/***************************/
/* CIRCUIT END, DARK START */
/***************************/

:: dark_tut
\> You step through the door-

\> Pure black. You can't see a thing.

\> You feel for the door behind you, only to find a smooth stone wall behind you.

\> [[...|dark_tut2]]

::dark_tut2







\> Okay. This is fine. You're fine! There's just no door where there was a door, and you're in a pitch black room. Textbook fine.

\> After a long moment, you feel around. The space is narrow enough that you can feel both sides with your arms out.

\>> [[Start moving forwards.|dark_tut_crunch1]]

::dark_tut_crunch1








\> You hear something crunch under your feet. Nothing could possibly make you check what it is, but you take note.

\>> [[Another.|dark_tut_step1]]

::dark_tut_step1








\> You take another step.

\>> [[Another.|dark_tut_groove]]


::dark_tut_groove








\> You take another step-

\> And nearly trip. There's something making the ground uneven here.

\> You kneel down and feel it out with your hands - Against the cool stone floor, you can feel a wooden triangle inlaid into the ground.

\> That's enough, you don't want splinters. On top of everything else.

\>> [[Another step.|dark_tut_step2]]

::dark_tut_step2








\> You take another step.

\>> [[Another.|dark_tut_crunch2]]

::dark_tut_crunch2








\> You hear something crunch under your feet. Nothing could possibly make you check what it is, but you take note.

\>> [[Another.|dark_tut_crunch3]]

::dark_tut_crunch3








\> You hear something crunch under your feet. You take note.

\>> [[Another.|dark_tut_step3]]

::dark_tut_step3








\> You take another step.

\>> [[Another.|dark_tut_crunch4]]

::dark_tut_crunch4







<<set $dark_tut_press to 1>>
\> You hear something crunch under your feet. You take note.

\>> [[Another.|dark_tut_end]]

::dark_tut_end








\> The room seems to come to an end here. You fumble around looking for something, anything, you notice something you can press on the wall. You readjust-

\> And the floor tile below you crunches, sinks down and clicks.
<<if $dark_tut_press is 1>>
\> That's once.
<<else>>
That's $dark_tut_press times.
<</if>>
\>> [[Step down on it again.|dark_tut_end][$dark_tut_press to $dark_tut_press + 1]]

<<if $dark_tut_press is 4>>
\>> [[Press the button.|starting_room]]
<<else>>
\>> [[Press the button.|dark_tut_end][$dark_tut_press to 0]]
<</if>>




/***************************/
/* DARK END, TUTORIAL EXIT START */
/***************************/

